1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,700
It was a summer night, and the yard was full of the sound of crickets.

2
00:00:06,100 --> 00:00:08,760
Grandma, one more story, please! Just one!

3
00:00:09,160 --> 00:00:16,160
All right, all right, just one.  Once upon a time, a little girl lived at the foot of a mountain.

4
00:00:16,560 --> 00:00:19,880
Did she not want to go to sleep at night, just like me?

5
00:00:20,280 --> 00:00:23,410
[laughter] That's right, just like you.

6
00:00:24,410 --> 00:00:31,120
Before the story was over, the little girl had fallen asleep in her grandma's arms.

7
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:34,530
[sigh] This child is growing up so fast.
